        "industry": {
          "before": "B2B",
          "after": "Consumer"
        },
        "long_description": {
          "before": "14.ai operates brands autonomously. Our software runs the core machinery of a modern company, from demand generation to fulfillment to customer relationships.\r\n\r\nThe next iconic brands will run with far fewer people, tighter software loops, and much more operational intelligence. Our system connects acquisition, operations, support, and decision-making across the brands we build into one intelligent layer.\r\n\r\nWe use 14.ai to launch and run our own brands, improve the system in production, and make brand creation faster, measurable, and more programmable with every cycle.",
          "after": "We are building GloGlo, an AI companion for people with diabetes. GloGlo connects to CGMs and health data to explain what is driving highs, lows, and time in range, then turns those patterns into personalized insights, reminders, and daily guidance.\r\n\r\nWe are starting with people with Type 1 diabetes, a community we know firsthand through our cofounder Michael, who has lived with T1D for 17 years. Alongside the app, we make fast-acting glucose gummies for treating lows, giving us a trusted consumer entry point into the diabetes market.\r\n\r\nOur long-term goal is to become the everyday operating system for diabetes: understanding each person’s glucose, insulin, food, exercise, sleep, and habits so they can make better decisions and spend more time in range."
        },
        "one_liner": {
          "before": "AI engine powering autonomous brands starting with gloglo.com",
          "after": "AI companion helping people with diabetes stay in range"
        },
