        "industry": {
          "before": "Healthcare",
          "after": "B2B"
        },
        "long_description": {
          "before": "Cenote builds AI sales reps for online health clinics and deploys them for abandoned-cart and win-back campaigns.\r\n\r\nToday, digital and telehealth clinics rely on generic text blasts or human follow-up for speed-to-lead and customer reactivation. Since the lead has often gone cold and the outreach isn’t personalized, conversion is frequently below 1%.\r\n\r\nCenote’s AI agents reach out immediately, communicate on the patient’s preferred schedule, and operate across channels—dramatically increasing conversion rates and unlocking revenue that otherwise goes unrealized.",
          "after": "Cenote helps online D2C brands convert more shoppers through AI sales reps that can call and text.\r\n\r\nOnline stores rely on static websites, one-way email and SMS campaigns, and inside sales teams with limited availability. But many purchases are better suited to a conversation: shoppers have questions, need guidance, or simply are not excited to buy based on what's on the site alone.\r\n\r\nToday, those shoppers are poorly served. Abandoned-checkout campaigns are generic, call centers close, and slow human follow-up allows high-intent leads to go cold. Our customers often see conversion rates below 1% from traditional abandoned-checkout outreach.\r\n\r\nCenote's AI reps reach shoppers immediately, remember their context, and continue the conversation across channels and over time. This gives every interested shopper access to a personalized sales rep and helps brands recover revenue from leads they have already paid to acquire."
        },
        "one_liner": {
          "before": "AI agents that convert and retain patients for digital clinics",
          "after": "AI agents for conversational commerce"
        },
        "subindustry": {
          "before": "Healthcare",
          "after": "B2B -> Sales"
        },
        "tags": {
          "before": [
            "Artificial Intelligence",
            "Robotic Process Automation",
            "Health Tech",
            "B2B",
            "Healthcare"
          ],
          "after": [
            "B2B",
            "Digital Health",
            "E-commerce",
            "AI"
          ]
        },
        "team_size": {
          "before": 3,
          "after": 2
        }
      }
