      "changes": {
        "long_description": {
          "before": "Leadbay qualifies millions of Data-Signal-Scarce leads that couldn't be found before.\r\n\r\nTeams at L'Oréal, Saint-Gobain, Gerflor USA, Corgi, and Nespresso B2B have 3x'd their addressable market and 10x'd what they defined as \"qualified leads\". Talking to our customers, we used to hear, \"10 minutes on Leadbay beats 6 months with Clay and a GTM agency.\"\r\n\r\nCo-founders are Milan Stankovic (CTO) - PhD to make AI work with limited data, and Ludovic Granger (CEO). \r\n\r\nCreate an account.\r\nA new market is yours.\r\nleadbay.ai.",
          "after": "Leadbay qualifies leads for agentic workflows. \r\n\r\nWe're especially good at qualifying - low-data, low-signal - small and medium-sized businesses. Teams at L'Oréal, Saint-Gobain, Gerflor USA, Corgi, and Nespresso B2B have 3x'd their addressable market and 10x'd what they defined as \"qualified leads.\" Talking to our customers, we used to hear, \"10 minutes on Leadbay beats 6 months with Clay and a GTM agency.\"\r\n\r\nCo-founders are Milan Stankovic (CTO) - PhD to make AI work with limited data, and Ludovic Granger (CEO). \r\n\r\nCreate an account. \r\nA new market is yours.\r\nleadbay.ai"
        },
